      <p source="#source-388-423"><seg source="#source-388-423">ジンタは寂しい港町です</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-423-497"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-423-447"><rb>朔風</rb><rt>さかかぜ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-447-465">にうらぶれた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-465-489"><rb>潮騒</rb><rt>しほざい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-489-497">です</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-497-559"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-497-518"><rb>吐息</rb><rt>といき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-518-559">のやうにとぎれては続きます</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-559-612"><seg source="#source-559-612">濡れてゐるやうに　泣いてゐるやうに</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-612-701"><seg source="#source-612-645">ラツパ・たいこ・クラリ</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-648-690"><seg source="#source-645-648">オ</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-669-675">ママ</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-690-701">ネツト</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-701-748"><seg source="#source-701-748">ジンタは冬がやつて来た港町です</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-748-837"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-748-769"><rb>昨日</rb><rt>きのう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-769-781">の唄を　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-781-802"><rb>昨日</rb><rt>きのう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-802-805">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-805-832"><rb>生活</rb><rt>せいくわつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-832-837">を</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-837-876"><seg source="#source-837-876">潮騒のやうに歌つて通ります</seg></p>
    </body>
